{
  "name": "Automated US NHTSA Vehicle VIN Decoder & Safety Recall Auditor — Daily B2B Data & Compliance Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated US NHTSA Vehicle VIN Decoder & Safety Recall Auditor Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nBatch decode 17-character and partial Vehicle Identification Numbers (VINs), extract official technical specifications, and audit active safety recalls directly from U.S. NHTSA / Department of Transportation APIs.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/us-nhtsa-vehicle-vin-recall-auditor](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/us-nhtsa-vehicle-vin-recall-auditor)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: us-nhtsa-vehicle-vin-recall-auditor** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "da7c9d1f-4a59-5831-8995-cf11d7339108",
      "name": "Setup Instructions & Architecture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 7 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "f0645059-640c-5380-bce1-ec769728d0ce",
      "name": "Daily 07:00 AM Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/b2b-quant-apis~us-nhtsa-vehicle-vin-recall-auditor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"vins\": [\n    \"5YJSA1E26MF123456\",\n    \"1FTEW1EP5MFA12345\"\n  ],\n  \"check_recalls\": true\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "4788161f-8bb4-5717-aa30-0420351fb25e",
